--- !u!114 &108847636
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 108847632}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b0f38aadea3c5394eb65c6e2dd2a2066, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialouge:
    Name: General Ironwood
    Sentences:
    - 'Agent, do you copy? '
    - Good - you are already where you are needed, what's left around you... is what
      the shapes have done to this place.
    - To be honest... we created them. The shapes were our weapon. Meant to be the
      best combat unit.
    - They bleed blue, synthetic blood - engineered, artificial. We thought we were
      optimistic. We were wrong.
    - Something triggered them. They went berserk and turned on everything - our
      facilities, our cities, the people. Three battalions gone in 48 hours.
    - Here's the problem. Every soldier we sent in - our best men - the shapes could
      sense them. They are programmed to hunt down the target no matter what, our
      men couldnt stand a chance.
    - But you are different. Natural. For some reason they cant overwhelm you, you
      can get close, you can stand against them. you are not just our last option
      soldier. You are the only option we got.
    - they would have already moved to your position, be prepared, the first wave
      might not be that bad, consider it as a warmUp.
    - they dont stop they keep on coming, every wave completes they get faster, stronger.
      We will be watching your vitals from HQ. Thats all the help i can give you,
      soldier.
    - Good luck out there. You're going to need it.
    - Stay Alive!
  _gameOverDialogue:
    Name: General Ironwood
    Sentences:
    - Agent. We lost you.
    - You might have knew the odds, yet you fought!
    - The fight goes on because you bought us time. That means everything.
    - Rest in peace. You will be remembered!
  _chaserDialogue:
    Name: 
    Sentences: []
  _smasherDialogue:
    Name: 
    Sentences: []
  _tracerDialogue:
    Name: 
    Sentences: []
